    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tires by late afternoon</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Left hand clumsy; speech slurs when tired; no new weakness, numbness, or visual loss</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or lightheadedness on standing</td></tr><tr><td>Hematologic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bruising or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low at times and readily tearful; sleeping poorly; no thoughts of death or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

